{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac7e4d413418fb8817f907a97d65f00072cd2e812c693fd3e53106bb73ef6dba",
      "text": "拍摄写真画报的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e17fe7c45d61501e0a50a4faa01dcc3a900e2a3fcc15d6ad82bff291d1b9a19",
      "text": "翼先生，下次工作的资料送到了，\n这就交给您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fa2117a0e9b83aa4a18cb2803a82a08f85926c15643ad82ffbc48e341734e2f",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n这个，是服装的参考图吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12294f0ff899e26edd360f44e0d1a017ae672cd793704628b50340311a0aec41",
      "text": "是的。因为主题是黑白单色，\n服装也大多是款式简练的设计呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9f9693522ed54e12986848e624fb0364840d3aa1809b3b975acf429e701dfcf",
      "text": "为了契合“以服装决胜负”的概念，\n饰品好像配得比较少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341dd3aa5520abc2364746eb147181dac2cc2afbdf2e190fdbe7418d503a927a",
      "text": "虽然一想到当天的情景会紧张，\n但我开始期待穿上这身衣服了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6abfbdb5354f4ff2755e2f477381e4f47c4b06f2d54dc01490eea595c0e33e3",
      "text": "我会努力让看到时尚杂志的大家，\n都产生想要这套衣服的想法的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:142a15216b9e80154610e54043819e225f59b2a12252f58339e3a645d0aa685d",
      "text": "翼先生的话一定能穿出绝佳风采的。\n我也会全力支持您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4cf225881d29f9726ddbb55e761de99c7183dbaa718ba5665c8f1f4b5f2fa9a",
      "text": "谢谢你。真的让人很安心呢。\n我先去了解一下这个服装品牌吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6244d590a0b731a25fd31316d34f37de12d5e9faa1fca55f254c9e64c14aec49",
      "text": "我会把杂志的过往期数等资料\n准备好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d170b152e22f95d7ef21203edc3446ecc4f4cdde9bf2448c7583758d57a0f8ed",
      "text": "好的。那就拜托你了，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
